{"id": "69440c5c-6750-4c2f-b202-18a06eb329d6", "slug": "system-interface-2", "title": "System Interface", "description": "System Interface Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"System Interface\"\ndescription: \"System Interface Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  secondary: \"#161618\"\n  accent: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#161618\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#666666\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# System Interface\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 344; favorites: 21; remixes: 4.\nTags: pricing, section, animated, cta, billing.\n## Overview\nSystem Interface Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\n\nSYNAPSE Solutions Framework API Hub Plans Portal Access Launch Free Network State: Active Map your system architecture on the fly Link and synchronize remote endpoints with perfect accuracy. A dynamic interface to plot…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Map your system architecture on the fly.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FFFFFF, secondary #161618, accent #FFFFFF, background #FFFFFF, surface #161618, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>System Interface</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: #0f0f11;\" class=\"w-screen h-screen overflow-hidden flex flex-col text-white antialiased selection:bg-white/20 relative\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL-simulated Canvas Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"bg-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Header Navigation -->\n    <header class=\"w-full flex justify-between items-center px-6 py-5 z-50 shrink-0 relative\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer\">\n            <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center bg-white/5\">\n                <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-widest text-gray-200\">SYNAPSE</span>\n        </div>\n        <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-light text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Solutions</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-light text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Framework</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-light text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">API Hub</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-light text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Plans</a>\n        </nav>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-medium text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors hidden sm:block\">Portal Access</a>\n            <button class=\"h-8 px-4 rounded-md bg-white/10 border border-white/10 text-white text-xs font-medium hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors\">\n                Launch Free\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Main Flex Layout -->\n    <main class=\"flex-1 w-full max-w-[1400px] mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-12 lg:gap-32 z-10 relative px-6 lg:px-12 overflow-y-auto lg:overflow-hidden py-12 lg:py-0\">\n\n        <!-- Hero Content -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center lg:items-start text-center lg:text-left z-20 max-w-2xl lg:max-w-xl shrink-0\">\n            <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 mb-6 cursor-pointer hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">\n                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-400 animate-pulse\"></div>\n                <span class=\"text-xs scale-90 font-medium tracking-wide text-gray-300 uppercase block\">Network State: Active</span>\n            </div>\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mb-6 leading-tight\">\n                Map your system <br class=\"hidden md:block\"/> architecture on the fly\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"text-sm font-light text-gray-400 max-w-xl mb-8 leading-relaxed\">\n                Link and synchronize remote endpoints with perfect accuracy. A dynamic interface to plot routines, manage packages, and track live signals seamlessly.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4\">\n                <button class=\"h-10 px-6 rounded-lg bg-white text-black text-xs font-medium hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.15)] hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(255,255,255,0.25)]\">\n                    Boot Environment\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"h-10 px-6 rounded-lg bg-[#1a1a1c] border border-white/10 text-gray-300 text-xs font-medium hover:bg-[#222225] hover:text-white transition-colors\">\n                    View API Guide\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Main UI Container -->\n        <div id=\"ui-container\" class=\"relative z-10 w-[350px] h-[350px] sm:w-[400px] sm:h-[400px] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-8 lg:mt-0 scale-90 sm:scale-100\">\n\n            <!-- Central Core -->\n            <div class=\"absolute w-28 h-28 flex items-center justify-center z-30 cursor-pointer group\">\n\n                <!-- Rotating Dashed Ring -->\n                <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full animate-[spin_15s_linear_infinite] opacity-40 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\">\n                    <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"60\" r=\"58\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 6\" />\n                </svg>\n\n                <!-- Outer Concentric Ring (Faint) -->\n                <svg class=\"absolute inset-[-10px] w-[calc(100%+20px)] h-[calc(100%+20px)] opacity-20\" viewBox=\"0 0 140 140\">\n                    <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"70\" r=\"69\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#444\" stroke-width=\"1\" />\n                </svg>\n\n                <!-- Inner Solid Progress Arc -->\n                <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full -rotate-90 text-gray-300 transition-all duration-1000 group-hover:text-white\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\">\n                    <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"60\" r=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"326\" stroke-dashoffset=\"240\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" class=\"transition-all duration-700 ease-out group-hover:stroke-dashoffset-160\" />\n                </svg>\n\n                <!-- Glowing Pulse Ring -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-[6px] rounded-full bg-white/5 blur-md animate-pulse z-0 pointer-events-none transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Core Button Background -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-[6px] bg-[#141416] rounded-full border border-white/5 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-[#1a1a1c] z-10\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.25em] font-medium text-gray-400 group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 ml-[0.2em] block scale-90\">ROOT</span>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Surrounding Nodes Configuration -->\n\n            <!-- Top Node -->\n            <div class=\"absolute flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-[72px] h-[72px] bg-[#161618] rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-white/15 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-white/[0.02] hover:-translate-y-[142px] group z-20 translate-x-0 -translate-y-[140px]\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:command-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-xl text-gray-500 group-hover:text-gray-200 mb-1.5 transition-colors duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-xs scale-75 origin-center block tracking-[0.15em] text-gray-600 group-hover:text-gray-400 font-medium ml-[0.1em] transition-colors duration-300\">TERMINAL</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Top Right Node -->\n            <div class=\"absolute flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-[72px] h-[72px] bg-[#161618] rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-white/15 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-white/[0.02] group z-20 translate-x-[125px] -translate-y-[72px] hover:translate-x-[127px] hover:-translate-y-[74px]\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chat-round-line-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-xl text-gray-500 group-hover:text-gray-200 mb-1.5 transition-colors duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-xs scale-75 origin-center block tracking-[0.15em] text-gray-600 group-hover:text-gray-400 font-medium ml-[0.1em] transition-colors duration-300\">SIGNAL</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Right Node -->\n            <div class=\"absolute flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-[72px] h-[72px] bg-[#161618] rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-white/15 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-white/[0.02] group z-20 translate-x-[125px] translate-y-[72px] hover:translate-x-[127px] hover:translate-y-[74px]\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:eye-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-xl text-gray-500 group-hover:text-gray-200 mb-1.5 transition-colors duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-xs scale-75 origin-center block tracking-[0.15em] text-gray-600 group-hover:text-gray-400 font-medium ml-[0.1em] transition-colors duration-300\">OUTPUT</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Node -->\n            <div class=\"absolute flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-[72px] h-[72px] bg-[#161618] rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-white/15 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-white/[0.02] group z-20 translate-x-0 translate-y-[140px] hover:translate-y-[142px]\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:folder-with-files-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-xl text-gray-500 group-hover:text-gray-200 mb-1.5 transition-colors duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-xs scale-75 origin-center block tracking-[0.15em] text-gray-600 group-hover:text-gray-400 font-medium ml-[0.1em] transition-colors duration-300\">BUNDLE</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Left Node -->\n            <div class=\"absolute flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-[72px] h-[72px] bg-[#161618] rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-white/15 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-white/[0.02] group z-20 -translate-x-[125px] translate-y-[72px] hover:-translate-x-[127px] hover:translate-y-[74px]\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:maximize-square-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-xl text-gray-500 group-hover:text-gray-200 mb-1.5 transition-colors duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-xs scale-75 origin-center block tracking-[0.15em] text-gray-600 group-hover:text-gray-400 font-medium ml-[0.1em] transition-colors duration-300\">DETECT</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Top Left Node -->\n            <div class=\"absolute flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-[72px] h-[72px] bg-[#161618] rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-white/15 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-white/[0.02] group z-20 -translate-x-[125px] -translate-y-[72px] hover:-translate-x-[127px] hover:-translate-y-[74px]\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:code-square-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-xl text-gray-500 group-hover:text-gray-200 mb-1.5 transition-colors duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-xs scale-75 origin-center block tracking-[0.15em] text-gray-600 group-hover:text-gray-400 font-medium ml-[0.1em] transition-colors duration-300\">ROUTER</span>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Simulation Script -->\n    <script>\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('bg-canvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n\n        let width, height, cx, cy;\n        const dots = [];\n        const spacing = 35;\n        let time = 0;\n\n        function resize() {\n            width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n\n            // Re-align drawing center to the actual visual HTML container\n            const uiContainer = document.getElementById('ui-container');\n            if (uiContainer) {\n                const rect = uiContainer.getBoundingClientRect();\n                cx = rect.left + rect.width / 2;\n                cy = rect.top + rect.height / 2;\n            } else {\n                cx = width / 2;\n                cy = height / 2;\n            }\n\n            initDots();\n        }\n\n        function initDots() {\n            dots.length = 0;\n            const cols = Math.ceil(width / spacing);\n            const rows = Math.ceil(height / spacing);\n\n            // Offset to center the grid based on window\n            const startX = (width - (cols * spacing)) / 2;\n            const startY = (height - (rows * spacing)) / 2;\n\n            for (let i = -1; i <= cols + 1; i++) {\n                for (let j = -1; j <= rows + 1; j++) {\n                    const x = startX + i * spacing;\n                    const y = startY + j * spacing;\n\n                    const dist = Math.hypot(x - cx, y - cy);\n                    dots.push({ x, y, baseX: x, baseY: y, dist });\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n        window.addEventListener('load', resize); // Ensure accurate container coordinates after layout\n        resize();\n\n        function draw() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            // Draw Dots\n            dots.forEach(dot => {\n                const waveX = Math.sin(dot.baseX * 0.01 + time) * 2;\n                const waveY = Math.cos(dot.baseY * 0.01 + time) * 2;\n\n                const currentX = dot.baseX + waveX;\n                const currentY = dot.baseY + waveY;\n\n                const distToCenter = Math.hypot(currentX - cx, currentY - cy);\n\n                const maxDist = Math.max(width, height) / 1.5;\n                let opacity = 1 - (distToCenter / maxDist);\n                if (opacity < 0.05) opacity = 0.05;\n\n                const isVerticalLine = Math.abs(currentX - cx) < spacing / 2;\n                const isHorizontalLine = Math.abs(currentY - cy) < spacing / 2;\n\n                let dotSize = 1;\n                let fillStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${opacity * 0.15})`;\n\n                if (distToCenter < 180) {\n                    dotSize = 1.2;\n                    fillStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${opacity * 0.4})`;\n                }\n\n                if ((isVerticalLine || isHorizontalLine) && distToCenter < 300) {\n                    dotSize = 1.5;\n                    fillStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${opacity * 0.6})`;\n                }\n\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.arc(currentX, currentY, dotSize, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                ctx.fillStyle = fillStyle;\n                ctx.fill();\n            });\n\n            // Draw connecting lines to nodes\n            const nodeAngles = [270, 330, 30, 90, 150, 210];\n            const nodeRadius = 145;\n\n            ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n            ctx.setLineDash([2, 8]);\n            ctx.lineDashOffset = -time * 15;\n\n            nodeAngles.forEach(angle => {\n                const rad = angle * Math.PI / 180;\n                const tx = cx + Math.cos(rad) * nodeRadius;\n                const ty = cy + Math.sin(rad) * nodeRadius;\n\n                const gradient = ctx.createLinearGradient(cx, cy, tx, ty);\n                gradient.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15)');\n                gradient.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02)');\n\n                ctx.strokeStyle = gradient;\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.moveTo(cx, cy);\n                ctx.lineTo(tx, ty);\n                ctx.stroke();\n            });\n\n            // Subtle outer rings in background\n            ctx.setLineDash([1, 12]);\n            ctx.lineDashOffset = time * 5;\n            ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03)';\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.arc(cx, cy, 220, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n            ctx.stroke();\n\n            time += 0.02;\n            requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n        }\n\n        draw();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "system-interface-2.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/system-interface-2.jpg", "source_name": "system-interface-2-DESIGN.md", "views": 443, "forks": 9, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T14:11:49.334557+00:00"}